OL,3,GNEWSA'Party leader has given me no red
OL,4,Alines' - new health minister Robbie
OL,5,AButler
OL,6,
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland's new health minister
OL,8,Fhas said his party leader has given him
OL,9,F"no red lines" in the wake of a policy
OL,10,Frow that saw his predecessor quit.
OL,12,FRobbie Butler, who was appointed by
OL,13,FUlster Unionist Party (UUP) leader Jon
OL,14,FBurrows on Thursday, said any decisions
OL,15,Fhe makes will be based on "expert
OL,16,Fevidence opinion" as well as the
OL,17,F"voices of the people".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
