OL,3,GNEWSA'Party leader has given me no red
OL,4,Alines' - new health minister Robbie
OL,5,AButler
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis party colleague Mike Nesbitt
OL,8,Fresigned after a fall out with Burrows
OL,9,Fover withdrawing emergency general
OL,10,Fsurgery services from Causeway
OL,11,FHospital.
OL,13,FBurrows had declared he would never
OL,14,Fsupport the withdrawal of the service
OL,15,Fduring a public meeting, a view Nesbitt
OL,16,Fsaid he only discovered by "monitoring
OL,17,Fthe media".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
